cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this code in your research, please cite this repository and the associated publication."

title: "Analysis workflow for realized niche breadth in Atta leaf-cutting ants"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "García Castillo"
    given-names: "Diego Fernando"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3212-5417"

repository-code: "https://github.com/fernandoGarcia21/Atta-Realized-Niche-Breadth"

abstract: >
  Python analysis workflow associated with a study of realized niche breadth
  in Atta cephalotes and Atta laevigata across environmental gradients in
  Santander, Colombia. The repository includes workflows for hemispherical
  image processing, environmental characterization, statistical analyses,
  ERA5-Land climatic data processing, and figure generation.

keywords:
  - Atta
  - Atta cephalotes
  - Atta laevigata
  - realized niche breadth
  - leaf-cutting ants
  - environmental gradients
  - ERA5-Land
  - Colombia

